    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλοΐζομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλοῦς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>behave
